<title>USA: Gabelli group lifts stake in Goulds Pumps.</title>
<headline>Gabelli group lifts stake in Goulds Pumps.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment advisor Mario Gabelli said Friday it raised its stake in Goulds Pumps Inc to 2,995,069 common shares or 14.05 percent from 13.05 previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include a net of 209,600 common shares bought between August 20 and October 15 at prices ranging from $21.6250 to $22.50 per share.</p>
</text>
